      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Keeping all the above things in mind, Petitioner is entitled to the following compensation:-\n i) PAIN AND SUFFERING:-"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e0278ba11382487cb15720e06de7f75a_98",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "After the accident, the Petitioner was treated at Aadichunchanagiri Hospital wherein admitted and treated as an inpatient from 23.09.2022 to 13.10.2022 and was SCCH - 25 12 MVC No. 7019/2022 diagnosed and underwent surgery which can be made"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4abd261af6df41199851895781841096_99",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Considering that the nature of injury he has undergone is grievous and simple, the Petitioner is awarded a sum of Rs.60,000/- under this head."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b1ccdc0d436c474899b76967331444d8_100",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Suresha vs Shekaraiah on 19 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/37445310/\n5 ii) MEDICAL EXPENSES:\nThe Petitioner has pleaded that he has spent a sum of Rs.1,50,000/- towards treatment, medicines,\nconveyance, food and no"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6759191e6aa240e0a2e1341ea1e41af0_101",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In this regard, he has produced medical bills as per Exs.P.9 & 17 for a sum of Rs.28,158/- & Rs.15,380/- in total Rs.43,538/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d7fc319da09b4a52a3cfd37e85022b15_102",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "There is no contrary evidence against these bills from the Respondents."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e08ac8a5af8c4c0d9ee1730760cca391_103",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the petitioner is entitled for the above said amount under this head."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "20ca4581798447bf98e1122c72365460_104",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\niii) LOSS OF INCOME DURING LAID UP PERIOD:-\nAs mentioned above the petitioner has sustained grievous and simple injuries."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "372d7ed56f8744fea086e3187385628c_105",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner has produced discharge summary at Ex.P.6 of Aadichunchanagiri Hospital to show the SCCH - 25 13 MVC No. 7019/2022 duration and treatment in the said hospital."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a70ea463287b49b1a3809dac37be7275_106",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, considering the nature of injuries it can be said that the Petitioner may have required at least One month time for recovering from the injuries sustained by him."
    },
