        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore,\nlooking to the earlier treatment cost and nature of injuries, evidence on record, it appears it would be justifiable if an amount of Rs.20,000/- is awarded under this head."
