      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "17. The Petitioner is entitled to compensation under the following heads:\n1. Pain & suffering Rs.60,000/-\n2. Medical expenses Rs.43,538/-\n3. Loss of income during laid up Rs.15,500/-\nperiod SCCH - 25 16 MVC No. 7019/2022 4. Loss of future i"
